; Program 4.12: Sum of integers S = 1 + 2 + ... + n
; Source: Дьяконов, «Справочник по расчётам на микрокалькуляторах», 1985, p.66-67 (book61.pdf pages 67-68)
; Input: n in X.  Output: S in X.  R0 is the loop counter (FL0).
; The 0 at 01 clears the accumulator before the loop.
;
; Book example: n = 10 (keys В/О, С/П) -> S = 55
; @input 10
; @expect X=55
;
00: П0 0 ИП0 + FL0 02 С/П
